{"metabox":"1","type":"annotation","subject":"apps/clax_app/home/tests/home.test.js","issuer":"mailto:alex@kesling.co","issuer_type":"ai","created_at":"2026-10-18T05:29:39.746836Z","id":"3a33be85e361bbc0a225e0be4832dde804c24f15953808dae42dec7cffecf50a","body":{"detail":"Seen across repeated runs of web/e2e/home-app.spec.ts \"its tests in the inspect view\" (about one run in three, with the page's own entries consistent: one #group entry on the stack, no pending back). Only the test \"a tap opens the folder over a dimmed grid; its name renames; back closes it\" relies on back, as the first history use of the run, and passes steadily. The page's back handling is a single window popstate listener (home.js folderNav).","kind":"comment","span":{"start":{"line":862},"end":{"line":931},"content_hash":"07552df6cfec7cbb94a2fc6a99edb0f7e3ad7624ea305785c410c531bc8596b7"},"summary":"These folder tests close by the scrim, not history.back(): in the inspect harness's frame a script's history.back() after a script-made #group entry sometimes produced no popstate within 3 s","tags":["session:claude-code:e697d918-f48a-41f9-aac4-4be74128e8ae"]}}
{"metabox":"1","type":"annotation","subject":"apps/clax_app/home/tests/home.test.js","issuer":"mailto:alex@kesling.co","issuer_type":"ai","created_at":"2026-10-18T15:54:20.600606Z","id":"0379d2948688a252ea0fbcc8254baac9180012473c0c55297301e3833b02c7ce","body":{"detail":"Seen across repeated runs of web/e2e/home-app.spec.ts \"its tests in the inspect view\" (about one run in three, with the page's own entries consistent: one #group entry on the stack, no pending back). The tests that rely on back are \"a tap opens the folder over a dimmed grid; its name renames; back closes it\" and \"back closes the group's own menu, and only it; Escape leaves its history entry too\" (two backs over #menu entries); both passed four runs in a row (bazelisk test //web:e2e_rest --test_arg=--grep=home-app --runs_per_test=3, then once more). The page's back handling is a single window popstate listener (home.js nav).","kind":"comment","span":{"start":{"line":918},"end":{"line":1072},"content_hash":"66baeab3a19699cc8e7603a2d9d0f52d55d45b1c679f03689671345b2ee43a03"},"summary":"These folder tests close by the scrim, not history.back(): in the inspect harness's frame a script's history.back() after a script-made #group entry sometimes produced no popstate within 3 s","supersedes":"3a33be85e361bbc0a225e0be4832dde804c24f15953808dae42dec7cffecf50a","tags":["session:claude-code:e697d918-f48a-41f9-aac4-4be74128e8ae"]}}
{"metabox":"1","type":"annotation","subject":"apps/clax_app/home/tests/home.test.js","issuer":"mailto:alex@kesling.co","issuer_type":"ai","created_at":"2026-10-18T16:44:55.948875Z","id":"ac0913918db9d29bac881b423fbedf51a8c534077f00e55df7028f6223f0bd3e","body":{"detail":"Seen across repeated runs of web/e2e/home-app.spec.ts \"its tests in the inspect view\" (about one run in three, with the page's own entries consistent: one #group entry on the stack, no pending back). The tests that rely on back are \"a tap opens the folder over a dimmed grid; its name renames; back closes it\" and \"back closes the group's own menu, and only it; Escape leaves its history entry too\" (two backs over #menu entries); both passed four runs in a row (bazelisk test //web:e2e_rest --test_arg=--grep=home-app --runs_per_test=3, then once more). The page's back handling is a single window popstate listener (home.js nav).","kind":"comment","span":{"start":{"line":919},"end":{"line":1073},"content_hash":"66baeab3a19699cc8e7603a2d9d0f52d55d45b1c679f03689671345b2ee43a03"},"summary":"These folder tests close by the scrim, not history.back(): in the inspect harness's frame a script's history.back() after a script-made #group entry sometimes produced no popstate within 3 s","supersedes":"0379d2948688a252ea0fbcc8254baac9180012473c0c55297301e3833b02c7ce","tags":["session:claude-code:e697d918-f48a-41f9-aac4-4be74128e8ae"]}}
{"metabox":"1","type":"annotation","subject":"apps/clax_app/home/tests/home.test.js","issuer":"mailto:alex@kesling.co","issuer_type":"ai","created_at":"2026-10-19T20:28:08.066553Z","id":"afe9254a5db355a10cdabb0faf036618b426fb0b2b58f02708263e153af2f815","body":{"kind":"comment","references":"ac0913918db9d29bac881b423fbedf51a8c534077f00e55df7028f6223f0bd3e","summary":"The folder overlay and its tests are gone (commit 2311cc2e1); the group name field's back test uses history.back() and passes in the inspect view. This record looks obsolete; left for the owner to close.","tags":["session:claude-code:e697d918-f48a-41f9-aac4-4be74128e8ae"]}}
